<title>USA: FirstFed Bancshares sets stock buyback.</title>
<headline>FirstFed Bancshares sets stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>DES PLAINES, Ill. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>FirstFed Bancshares Inc said Tuesday its board had approved a program to buy back up to 100,000 of its shares on the open market or through privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The company has nearly 3.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>FirstFed, holding company for First Federal Bank of Des Plaines, also said it had completed a stock buyback dated December 23, 1996. It said 200,000 shares were repurchased at an average price of $17.09 each.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
